<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan to issue T$8 bln in NCDs on Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan to issue T$8 bln in NCDs on Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank said on Tuesday it would issue T$8 billion in one-month negotiable certificates of deposit later in the day.</p>
<p>Bids will close at 3.00 pm (0700 GMT), a central bank official said.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
